### get_account_info

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"nominal account_info = $'Option<(String, u64, u32)>'\n\ninl get_account_info\n    (account_map : rust.ref (near.lookup_map near.account_id sm'.std_string))\n    (alias_map : rust.ref (near.lookup_map sm'.std_string alias_accounts))\n    (account_id : near.account_id)\n    : account_info\n    =\n    inl result : account_info =\n        $'(!account_map).get(&(!account_id)).and_then(|alias| (!alias_map).get(alias).and_then(|accounts| accounts.get(&(!account_id)).map(|(timestamp, index)| (alias.clone(), *timestamp, *index))))'\n\n    trace Debug\n        fun () => \"chat_contract.get_account_info\"\n        fun () => { account_id result = #?*result }\n\n    result","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  nominal account_info = $'Option<(String, u64, u32)>'

  inl get_account_info
      (account_map : rust.ref (near.lookup_map near.account_id sm'.std_string))
      (alias_map : rust.ref (near.lookup_map sm'.std_string alias_accounts))
      (account_id : near.account_id)
      : account_info
      =
      inl result : account_info =
          $'(!account_map).get(&(!account_id)).and_then(|alias| (!alias_map).get(alias).and_then(|accounts| accounts.get(&(!account_id)).map(|(timestamp, index)| (alias.clone(), *timestamp, *index))))'

      trace Debug
          fun () => "chat_contract.get_account_info"
          fun () => { account_id result = #?*result }

      result
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

